{"4163450": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HORDEKILL", "steam_appid": 4163450, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4277460], "detailed_description": "<h1>Supporter Pack</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/74d5eac42102eb280a5c2f48ceac6e45.avif?t=1783078152\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras_big/74d5eac42102eb280a5c2f48ceac6e45.avif?t=1783078152 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The HORDEKILL Supporter Pack includes three exclusive player skins, including two enemy-inspired skins, and lets you play as an enemy character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small collection of bonus content for players who enjoyed HORDEKILL and wish to support the creator.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HORDEKILL is a challenging third-person sci-fi cover shooter taking you to an alien world of grotesque visuals and brutal combat. In an unknown realm, you slay hordes of nightmarish monsters and receive gameplay-changing offerings from a higher entity that make every run different. You’ll explore and fight in a stunning sci-fi setting full of biomechanical sculptures and gruesome torture devices. Exterminate hundreds of extraterrestrial creatures and make it out alive through an underground cave system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-person prologue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.mp4?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Third-person combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/94ba08ff757438ce3052d1680ecd0908.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/94ba08ff757438ce3052d1680ecd0908.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay-changing cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/26a630783f844467b80d811c2e145af3.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/26a630783f844467b80d811c2e145af3.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, as after every wave you can pick gameplay-changing cards that make you stronger and the combat more dynamic. Earn powerful offerings between waves that can turn a desperate last stand into a massacre. From cards that make enemies fight each other to powerful elite cards that make you deal more damage and spawn grotesque beasts that help you in spectacular fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is from the perspective of a slave. You fight against your former masters, who conquered your planet and enslaved your race. Your kind were tortured and destined to be eaten by their higher Lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fellow escaped slave fights beside you and helps you with a shotgun, but his fate is to eventually fall in battle. With the right cards and skill, however, he can cover your back for just a little bit longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HORDEKILL is a challenging third-person sci-fi cover shooter taking you to an alien world of grotesque visuals and brutal combat. In an unknown realm, you slay hordes of nightmarish monsters and receive gameplay-changing offerings from a higher entity that make every run different. You’ll explore and fight in a stunning sci-fi setting full of biomechanical sculptures and gruesome torture devices. Exterminate hundreds of extraterrestrial creatures and make it out alive through an underground cave system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-person prologue</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/ba448eda02f4ddb6ed2c5ab81d4c7112.mp4?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Third-person combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/94ba08ff757438ce3052d1680ecd0908.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/94ba08ff757438ce3052d1680ecd0908.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay-changing cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/26a630783f844467b80d811c2e145af3.poster.avif?t=1783078152\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/extras/26a630783f844467b80d811c2e145af3.webm?t=1783078152\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different, as after every wave you can pick gameplay-changing cards that make you stronger and the combat more dynamic. Earn powerful offerings between waves that can turn a desperate last stand into a massacre. From cards that make enemies fight each other to powerful elite cards that make you deal more damage and spawn grotesque beasts that help you in spectacular fights.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is from the perspective of a slave. You fight against your former masters, who conquered your planet and enslaved your race. Your kind were tortured and destined to be eaten by their higher Lords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fellow escaped slave fights beside you and helps you with a shotgun, but his fate is to eventually fall in battle. With the right cards and skill, however, he can cover your back for just a little bit longer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "On an alien planet, slaves revolt against their cannibal masters.", "supported_languages": "English", "reviews": "“Extremely alien designs that look somewhere between H.R. Giger and Clive Barker.”<br>IGN<br><br>“Surreal as hell”<br>Cataraxia<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4163450/818cdfef